hed","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":"Intake review done: acceptance criteria, links, and normalized labels added","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":18,"created_at":"2026-10-29T08:33:14Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T02:00:14Z","closed_at":"2026-11-08T02:00:10Z","assignee":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Split from #1971 (its task list + leak 1), filed by queue worker triage (task 2873, 2026-10-29).\n\n## Problem\n\n`TestEveryExecFlagChangesSomething` (`pkgs/mcpx/internal/e2e/e2e_test.go`) does not enumerate the flags it guards. It has four hand-written rows (`--export`, `--launcher`, `--prefix`, `--typecheck`) and a comment \"Add a row when you add a flag\", while the exec/run flag set (`internal/cli/commands.go`) has ~23 flags — including three fixed by the historical #75 (`--no-launcher`, `--allow-repeat`, `--no-capture-console`) with no row. A new flag with no row passes; the \"flag accepted and ignored\" class (shipped three times before the guard existed) is not closed — it relies on memory, the thing the guard exists to replace. Its probe half is the model to copy: each row asserts the outcome with the flag and its absence without.\n\n## Scope (per #1971 Approach C)\n\n1. A **unit-speed completeness test** enumerating the real exec/run FlagSet (`flag.FlagSet.VisitAll` over the flag definitions in `internal/cli`) that fails when any flag has neither a probe row nor an exemption with a reason. The completeness half lives outside the e2e test so it fails locally in milliseconds.\n2. **Probe rows** for `--no-launcher`, `--allow-repeat`, `--no-capture-console` and every other unprobed flag with an observable effect, in the existing with/without shape.\n3. Exemptions explicit, reasoned, and **ratcheted** (pinned set may only shrink without a deliberate reasoned update).\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Completeness test enumerates the FlagSet and fails on a flag with no row/exemption; runs at unit speed.\n- All unprobed flags with observable effects gain with/without probe rows; the rest carry reasoned exemptions.\n- `pkgs/mcpx go test ./...` green in CI.\n- No flag behaviour changes — this guards existing behaviour only.\n\nParent: #1971 (leak 1, task list). Sibling: the settings effect guard from the same split is queue task 3261 (dedupe key repo-health:v1:fix:developing-today/code:issue:1971).\n","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/2188/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/2188/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}